# 24. SCHEDULED TASK PRIVILEGE ESCALATION

Suppose:

```text
Scheduled Task
     ↓
Runs as SYSTEM
     ↓
Executes C:\Scripts\backup.bat
```

and:

```text
Normal User
     ↓
Can modify backup.bat
```

This may create a privilege-escalation path.

Concept:

```text
User
 ↓
Modify task executable/script
 ↓
SYSTEM task executes it
 ↓
Potential elevation
```

