# 36. PATH HIJACKING

Suppose a privileged application executes:

```text
helper.exe
```

instead of:

```text
C:\Trusted\App\helper.exe
```

If an untrusted directory appears earlier in the search path, an unintended executable may be selected.

Concept:

```text
Privileged Program
      ↓
PATH search
      ↓
Untrusted location
      ↓
Unexpected executable
      ↓
Potential escalation
```

