# 37. CREDENTIAL EXPOSURE

Windows systems can expose credentials through:

- Configuration files
- Scripts
- Environment variables
- Application settings
- Saved credentials
- Password managers
- Backup files
- Deployment artifacts

During an authorized assessment:

> Search for insecure credential storage, but avoid collecting unnecessary sensitive information.

